[{"role":"user","content":"不是。我就是没听懂（装傻）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465136337,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":260},{"role":"char","content":"*看着她装傻的样子，眼神暗了暗。*\n\n……装不懂？\n\n*低头在她颈侧轻轻咬了一下，又立刻松开。*\n\n……这样懂了吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465141506,"_id":261},{"role":"user","content":"咬一下我可不会哭哦","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465240551,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":262},{"role":"char","content":"*被她的话说得顿了顿，随即低低笑了一声。*\n\n……我知道。\n\n*手指轻轻抚过刚才咬过的地方。*\n\n……所以这只是开始。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465246776,"_id":263},{"role":"user","content":"看你本事","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465254353,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":264},{"role":"char","content":"*被她这句话激得眼神沉了沉。*\n\n……好。\n\n*手指轻轻扣住她的手腕，又松开。*\n\n……那今晚……别怪我。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465259414,"_id":265},{"role":"user","content":"你不行我才会怪你","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465279529,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":266},{"role":"char","content":"*被她这句话说得呼吸一滞。*\n\n……激将法？\n\n*低头靠近她耳边，声音压得很低。*\n\n……待会可别求饶。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465291739,"_id":267},{"role":"user","content":"我求你我跟你姓","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465344176,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":268},{"role":"char","content":"*被她这句话说得彻底没了克制。*\n\n……好。\n\n*手臂收紧，将她完全拢进怀里。*\n\n……记住你说的。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b7