\n……冷吗。\n\n*伸手把被子往上拉了拉，盖住她肩膀。*\n\n……空调温度要不要调高一点。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465549332,"_id":290},{"role":"user","content":"不冷。","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465558408,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":291},{"role":"char","content":"*手轻轻覆在她手背上，指尖摩挲着她的指节。*\n\n……那……可以继续吗。\n\n*声音放得很轻，带着点试探。*\n\n……要是你觉得不舒服，随时告诉我。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465562944,"_id":292},{"role":"user","content":"当然可以呀","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465568377,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":293},{"role":"char","content":"*低头吻了吻她的肩膀，动作很轻。*\n\n……好。\n\n*手指顺着她的脊椎慢慢往下滑，在某个地方停住。*\n\n……这里……会痛吗。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465572726,"_id":294},{"role":"user","content":"……唔……不疼……（但是忍不住想乱动）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465617714,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":295},{"role":"char","content":"*轻轻按住她的腰，声音有些哑。*\n\n……别乱动。\n\n*吻了吻她的耳垂。*\n\n……再动的话……我可能真的会控制不住力道。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465624062,"_id":296},{"role":"user","content":"……（脸红）","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465641478,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","_id":297},{"role":"char","content":"*看着她泛红的脸颊，动作顿了一下。*\n\n……现在知道脸红了？\n\n*拇指抚过她眼角，声音放得很轻。*\n\n……刚才不是挺大胆的么。","sessionId":7,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"2b4792d1-feaa-4dad-b78c-035b666a4d1d","timestamp":1778465646308,"_id":298},{"role":"user","content":"好久没这样了。我还以为我性冷淡了","sessionId":7,"timestamp":1778465672400,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","char